# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in your own values. Never commit real keys.

# TMDB metadata fallback (spec §5). Get a free API key (v3 auth) from
# https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api. Optional: without it the app runs on
# addon-supplied metadata alone.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=

# IPTV + EPG subsystem (spec §8, ADR-0006/ADR-0015). OFF by default while IPTV
# work is paused: the subsystem refreshes playlists/Xtream catalogs and fetches
# XMLTV guides in the background, which puts steady load on real subscription
# servers every time a dev build starts or reloads. Set to `true` to opt in.
VITE_IPTV_ENABLED=

# Real-Debrid resolver (spec §6.4, ADR-0013). Your private API token from
# https://real-debrid.com/apitoken. Optional: without it the stream picker still
# lists/ranks candidates, but torrent sources can't be resolved to a playable
# link. User-supplied; never commit a real token.
VITE_REALDEBRID_TOKEN=
